  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Many young people today do not use PCs, and I think there are hurdles to buying a gaming PC and VR equipment.\nPS5 & PSVR2 is higher than Quest2 alone, but Quest2 has restrictions on PC worlds and PC avatars.\nPSVR2 can also reduce the processing load with eye tracking and foveated rendering, and should consume less power than PCVR.",
